      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, can you help me write a professional email to our resin supplier? We just got the invoice for this month but the quantity of resin they billed us for is higher than what we actually received in the shipment. I need to ask them for an explanation and a credit memo to fix the difference. Thanks.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
