      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what was that about a goblin in a jar? That's a bit weird. Anyway, can you finish the draft for me? It cut off after \"adjust the invoice for the over\". Also, can you make it sound a little more firm? We deal with this supplier a lot and we can't have these errors happening every month.",
